jobs.requirements:
- Strong interest in a career in computer science;
- Must meet the PhD admission and academic requirements of the partner universities;
- Keen to research in fields such as AI, Computer Vision, Deep Learning, Game AI, Natural Language Processing, Reinforcement Learning, Speech Recognition (preferably but not limited to these areas);
- Proficiency in differentiable programming frameworks like PyTorch, TensorFlow, and JAX;
- Master’s degree in computer science/engineering, statistics, mathematics, data science, or related fields;
- Not a recipient of other scholarships or financial awards;
- For existing PhD candidates at the partner universities, must be less than 2 years into the program and not have passed the Qualifying Examination (QE).

1、计算机科学/软件工程相关领域的本科;
2、需要后端基础,并且有ai平台开发相关的经验(熟悉k8s,后端开发,监控平台);
3、能够有用agent开发平台的经历优先;
4、开发过通用的cli工具,能够有比较好的前后端全栈开发能力有限,能够践行devops的习惯;
5、懂飞书开放平台开发(加分项) 。
